<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Order History — Mastex Catalog</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/site.css">
<style>
  :root{ --accent:#e8590c; --accent-2:#ff8c42; --accent-soft:#fff1e8; }
</style>
<script src="/js/theme.js"></script>
</head>
<body>

<div class="topbar">
  <div class="topbar-inner">
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="brand-mark">🕘</div>
      <div class="brand-text">
        <b>Order History</b>
        <span>Saved order lists</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a href="/" class="back-link" style="margin-left:auto;">
      <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M19 12H5"/><path d="M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
      All vendors
    </a>
    <a class="icon-btn" href="/favorites" title="All favourites">
      <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="12 2 15.09 8.26 22 9.27 17 14.14 18.18 21.02 12 17.77 5.82 21.02 7 14.14 2 9.27 8.91 8.26 12 2"/></svg>
      <span class="cart-badge" id="favoritesBadge">0</span>
    </a>
    <a class="icon-btn" href="/cart" title="Order list">
      <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="9" cy="21" r="1"/><circle cx="20" cy="21" r="1"/><path d="M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6"/></svg>
      <span class="cart-badge" id="cartBadge">0</span>
    </a>
    <button class="icon-btn" id="themeToggle" title="Toggle theme">
      <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 12.79A9 9 0 1 1 11.21 3 7 7 0 0 0 21 12.79z"/></svg>
    </button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="hero">
  <h1>Order history</h1>
  <p>Every order list you've saved from the cart. Each one is a frozen snapshot — prices here stay as they were when you saved it, even if the sheet changes later. Edit quantities directly, or restore an order back into your current cart to reorder or build on it.</p>
</div>

<div class="banner">
  <div class="banner-inner">
    <span>🕘</span>
    <span>Shared across everyone using this tool, same as the cart and favorites — there's no per-user login yet.</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="wrap" id="wrap"></div>

<div class="toast" id="toast"></div>

<script src="/js/cart.js"></script>
<script src="/js/favorites-badge.js"></script>
<script>
  window.__ORDERS__ = <%- JSON.stringify(orders) %>;
</script>
<script src="/js/orders.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
